  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 64784380ef34c6b4b9c460c24352565f, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 64784380ef34c6b4b9c460c24352565f, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - To Astrid<br>From Dad
  - "Thought you might like this Little Bear. The Southern Lights at IceCube! I know
    some people are freaked out by the auroras now since the Northern Lights went
    wild during the CME just before everything went dark. But I think they are beautiful.
    The sky is a wonder - and you know what I always say, \"No wonder, we die!\"
    I'm so glad you are at Elijah's place working with CERES. Just like we always
    talked about... well, I guess its not just like we talked about. \n\nGosh Astrid.
    I really miss you.\nLove, Dad"
  StreamingVisuals:
  - VisualAssetPath: Postcards/IceCube.png
    LowResAssetPath: Postcards/LOW_RES_IceCube.png
